    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. You mention the \"lack of formal business register\" in Sample B as a reason for the low score. Do you think the speaker in Sample B is actually less capable of strategic thinking or understands the business concepts less than the speaker in Sample A, or is it strictly just about the way they talk?",
